  "description": "Welcome back to Furin High School, an institution infamous for its population of brawny brutes who solve every conflict with a show of strength. Some of the students even formed a group, Bofurin, which protects the town. Haruka Sakura, a first-year student who moved in from out of town, is only interested in one thing: fighting his way to the top! <br><br>\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll, edited)",
  "siteUrl": "https://anilist.co/anime/178680",
  "characters": [
    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 230204,
        "name": {
          "full": "Haruka Sakura",
          "native": "桜遥",
          "alternative": [
            "Othello-kun"
          ]
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b230204-cNRNjAj1FP4j.png"
        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 169 cm\n\nHaruka Sakura is a high school student in his first year. He attends Fuurin, a school known as a delinquent school, with aspirations to reach the top. He admires strong people. Rejected by others for his rough appearance, being alone was natural for him.  Hated by others and sitting at the bottom of the social strata, Sakura believes fighting is his only saving grace and that by winning those fights, he thinks he can feel his worth. He tries to keep an image of a ruthless and tough exterior, but in reality, he is kind-hearted. He easily gets embarrassed by compliments on his good acts. \n\n(Source: Official Website)",
        "gender": "Male",
        "age": "15-"
      },
