        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b255629-dnDEPOiRH5Wo.jpg"
        },
        "description": "**Height:** 174 cm\n\nA first-year student at Furin High School in Class 1. Suo has a refreshing smile and is pleasant to everyone he meets, but his outrageous jokes can cause chaos to the people around him. Despite his pleasantness, he can present an icy personality that leaves no tolerance for people who lack decorum. Suo's an enigma as he usually shows no emotions nor reveals his true feelings. He has a unique fighting style that resembles both kung fu and aikido. \n\n(Source: WIND BREAKER Official Website)",
