        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b255630-lz7qcvEvmj3y.jpg"
        },
        "description": "**Height:** 188cm\n\nA third-year student at Furin High School in Class 1. Umemiya is Bofurin's representative, meaning he stands at the top. With his friendly smile and amicable personality, he's a charismatic man who garners absolute trust from the people around him — not just the students at Furin High School but also from people around town. He's not just physically strong, however — with the tenacity to handle anything thrown his way, his very existence can overwhelm the people around him in a single shout. He likes to grow vegetables as a hobby.\n\n(Source: WIND BREAKER Official Website)",
