        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 165cm\n\nA first-year student at Furin High School in Class 1. Toshiyuki’s gentle-mannered personality and thoughtfulness make him popular with the ladies, but he’s no pushover — his fighting abilities are the real deal. A lover of games, he'll play them whenever he has some free time, making it his daily routine to try and get game login bonuses. He likes to add “chan” to his close friends’ names as a term of endearment. He is revered as one of the five strongest of his grade.\n\n(Source: WIND BREAKER Official Website, edited)",
