        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b255627-UG5olFBkfpTO.jpg"
        },
        "description": "**Height:** 163 cm \n\nA first-year student at Furin High School in Class 1. Nirei is weak at fighting, but his frank personality livens up the room — he's the life of the class. He wants to protect the town more than anybody else and thus has always aspired to become a student at Furin High School. Nirei always carries a notepad and pen in his chest pocket. He's a well-informed person whose hobby is collecting and analyzing data on people he thinks are cool. \n\n(Source: WIND BREAKER Official Website)",
