        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b255628-GE1KFrRO4cPK.jpg"
        },
        "description": "**Height:** 192 cm\n\nA first-year student at Furin High School in Class 1. Sugishita's a mad dog and quite talented — he's the only one who's been allowed to call himself \"Bofurin\" since middle school. His motivation and driving force come from his excessive loyalty and devotion to Umemiya - whatever Umemiya says, goes. He's usually quiet and has a unique sway as he walks. When he gets mad, though, he's the most unpredictable of them all. \n\n(Source: WIND BREAKER Official Website)",
