          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b347857-eva6DjZPHz1J.png"
        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 188cm\n\nEndo is a laid-back young man that is always shown to have a carefree and warm nature when fighting.\n\n~!Later, it is revealed that Endo he is a very dangerous individual that, not only is extremely careful with Chika Takiishi, but also reveres him as a god. He believes that he was born to see Takiishi fight, hence why he follows Takiishi around. He is shown to be extremely aggressive if things don’t go his way, revealing his troubled obsession with being pleased. !~",
